# The Rust build directory — 1.2 GB of relay build artefacts, and by far the largest thing in
# this build context. It was landing whole in the `COPY . .` layer of the JS images, which do
# not contain or use a single byte of it: it made up 1.17 GB of a 2.2 GB API image. This is
# also what made the image "too large to export" and prompted the static-ffmpeg workaround
# that broke server-side transcoding (see api/Dockerfile).
